OL,3,GNEWSANew #10m hotel approved at former
OL,4,Afactory site
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new #10m hotel is a "real vote of
OL,7,Fconfidence" in the future of a market
OL,8,Ftown, a councillor has said.
OL,10,FNorth Norfolk District Council has
OL,11,Fapproved an application for a Premier
OL,12,FInn to be built on the outskirts of
OL,13,FNorth Walsham, Norfolk.
OL,15,FLucy Shires, a Liberal Democrat
OL,16,Fcouncillor for the town, celebrated the
OL,17,Fbrand coming to the area, adding she
OL,18,Fhoped it would attract more visitors
OL,19,Fand boost jobs.
OL,21,FIt will be built on the former Crane
OL,22,FFruehauf site off Cromer Road.
